  ${C_CYAN}install [cli|all|list]${C_RESET}       Install or inspect external LLM CLIs (--update, --force, --list)
  ${C_CYAN}update [cli|all]${C_RESET}             Check installed CLIs (--check); apply only confirmed newer releases (--apply)

${C_YELLOW}Cluster & Remote Operations:${C_RESET}
