# -----------------------------------------------------------------------------
# Command: freetier  (Model Studio free-tier quota sync for Kimi Code)
# Fetch free-tier quotas via the Bailian CLI (`bl usage free`) and rewrite the
# managed [providers.alibaba] / [models."alibaba/..."] block of the Kimi Code
# config.toml so it only lists models that still have quota remaining. Every
# other provider/model (kimo's ollama-* aliases, managed:kimi-code, anthropic,
# alibaba-token-plan, ...) is preserved. Ported from kimi-freetier-sync.sh;
# same data source, filters and TOML target.
# -----------------------------------------------------------------------------
KIMI_FT_PROVIDER="alibaba"
KIMI_FT_ALIAS_PREFIX="alibaba/"
KIMI_FT_BASE_URL_DEFAULT="https://dashscope-intl.aliyuncs.com/compatible-mode/v1"
KIMI_FT_CONSOLE_URL="https://modelstudio.console.alibabacloud.com/ap-southeast-1/costing-balance/free-quota"
KIMI_FT_CONSOLE_SITE="international"
